WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask about a video
you posted in Instagram.

00:00:02.936 --> 00:00:04.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
Your daughter has
a way of traveling.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She invented it.
-She invented it.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.173 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.843
-Well, let's show a clip first,
and then you can explain.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:10.543 line:92%
This is her going on a --

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is how
we move through airports.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:17.283
And now the V.I.P. way
of moving through hotels.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.686 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Who needs a bellhop?

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, how did she come about
riding on a rolling --

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We got the
little rolling suitcase.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then she just
figured a way --

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:28.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
She saw it moving and she just
hopped on and got a ride.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:31.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, like, when we go
through airports or whatever

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you see her,
she just hangs on.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Like, she loves it.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:37.604
She loves it and, you know,
she wants to do it all the time.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.106
-People was like,
"You taught her how to do that."

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm too big to climb
on a suitcase like that.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.143 size:81% position:41% line:92%
How could I teach her?

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:43.943 line:92%
-Does she get excited, then,

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:46.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you start to pack up
the suitcases to go on a trip?

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.380 line:92%
Does she know what it means now?

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She doesn't, but the dogs do.
-Oh, yeah.

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.216 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-You know, Maximus does.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.219
You know, people out there
that have dogs know they --

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.221 line:92%
Max sits in the suitcase.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:55.655 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they give you that
look like --

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:59.392
You know, you just feel so bad.
You know, they got that look.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "Come on, man.
Don't do this, man.

00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't do this, man."
But, you know, we love them.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:07.700
And, you know,
dogs love you like nobody else.

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It's true.
Even when --

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
Let me congratulate you.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.305 size:78% position:39%
I heard you're about
to have another baby.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, we're gonna have
our second. Yeah.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How about that?
-I'm very excited.

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.877 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
Really great.
-Congratulations.

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:21.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm very excited.
-Yeah, that's beautiful.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And we think
our son knows it's coming,

00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, you know,
it's too hard to tell.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:26.820 line:92%
-Well, don't worry about it.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, they say
kids are like pancakes.

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:32.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
You mess up the first few.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.126 size:75% position:38% line:92%
You're gonna get it.

00:01:33.126 --> 00:01:35.595 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just all the stuff you
messed up on the first one,

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:38.531 line:92%
you'll get better on the second.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.232 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-That's good to know.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.468 size:84% position:42%
I'm gonna start calling
my oldest son Pancakes.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.335 line:92%
And I'll say it's his nickname.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, years later,
he'll say, "Why was that?"

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'll say,
"Let me tell you about Ice-T."

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:47.607 line:92%
-Yeah. You'll get it right.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:48.675 line:92%
You got it right this time.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:51.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, I want to --
We mentioned "New Jack City."

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:53.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
The casting of that --
This is one of those stories

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's almost
too good to be true.

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:57.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I got casted in
a men's bathroom.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Not like that.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.355 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
Not -- Nowadays,
you say stuff like that,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:06.759 size:88% position:44% line:92%
people jump all the way.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
No. I was in the bathroom
and I'm talking my craziness.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:11.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I said,
"You know, the problem is --"

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.032 line:92%
I'm just ranting to somebody --

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:14.767 size:75% position:38%
"If you could put me
under a microscope

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.437 size:84% position:42%
and find one molecule
in me that gave an 'F,'

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:18.638 line:92%
then they could angle me.

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:19.372 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But they can't angle me,

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I don't care about
anything," right?

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:23.209 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And the director,

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:24.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mario Van Peebles,
heard that and said,

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Whoever said that is gonna be
the star of my movie."

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he came out
and he started a conversation,

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.317 line:92%
which I thought he was lying,

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:34.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it resulted in
me getting that role.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:34.721 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:37.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just talking crap
in the crapper.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
-If there's anything
that young actors take away,

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.262 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I hope it's that.

00:02:42.262 --> 00:02:43.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
Always such
a pleasure to see you.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
Congratulations. Season 19.
-Thank you.

